# The Vercel project's Root Directory is `frontend`, so the CLI uploads the
# repository from its root. Everything that is not the frontend workspace — and
# the frontend's own dependency and build directories — is excluded: none of it
# is an input to the frontend build, and uploading the monorepo (plus several
# node_modules trees and the Rust target directory) makes each deployment
# needlessly large.
backend
mobile-app
admin
packages
soroban
.github
scripts
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/out
**/.expo
**/target
